{"id":"1626fd1f4581397b","group":"58","path":"58/batch07/58-df-zfc-order2-minimal-element.md","title":"ZFC Order2 Minimal Element","display":"df-zfc-order2-minimal-element — ZFC Order2 Minimal Element","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-order2-minimal-element","aliases":["58-df-zfc-order2-minimal-element","58-df-zfc-order6-minimal-element"],"display":"df-zfc-order2-minimal-element — ZFC Order2 Minimal Element","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-order2-minimal-element"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-order2-minimal-element</span><span>58-df-zfc-order6-minimal-element</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-order2-minimal-element — ZFC Order2 Minimal Element"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P,\\leq_P,X,R,A,m\\in V\">\\(P,\\leq_P,X,R,A,m\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\">\\(\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Poset}(X,R)\">\\(\\mathrm{Poset}(X,R)\\)</span> (poset predicates)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq P\">\\(A\\subseteq P\\)</span> (or <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq X\">\\(A\\subseteq X\\)</span> in the merged notation)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder2MinimalElement}_S(m,A,P,\\leq_P)\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcOrder2MinimalElement}_S(m,A,P,\\leq_P)\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder6MinimalElement}_S(X,R,A,m)\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcOrder6MinimalElement}_S(X,R,A,m)\\)</span> (merged predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order2\\text{-}minimal\\text{-}element} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcOrder2MinimalElement}_S(m,A,P,\\leq_P)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\\land A\\subseteq P\\land m\\in A\\land \\neg\\exists a\\in A\\;\\bigl(a\\neq m\\land\\langle a,m\\rangle\\in\\leq_P\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order2\\text{-}minimal\\text{-}element} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcOrder2MinimalElement}_S(m,A,P,\\leq_P)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\\land A\\subseteq P\\land m\\in A\\land \\neg\\exists a\\in A\\;\\bigl(a\\neq m\\land\\langle a,m\\rangle\\in\\leq_P\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order2\\text{-}minimal\\text{-}element} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcOrder6MinimalElement}_S(X,R,A,m)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Poset}(X,R)\\land A\\subseteq X\\land m\\in A\\land\\forall a\\in A\\;(\\langle a,m\\rangle\\in R\\to a=m)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order2\\text{-}minimal\\text{-}element} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcOrder6MinimalElement}_S(X,R,A,m)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Poset}(X,R)\\land A\\subseteq X\\land m\\in A\\land\\forall a\\in A\\;(\\langle a,m\\rangle\\in R\\to a=m)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Both variants include the ambient poset, its order, and the subset being searched. This blocks untyped relations from producing spurious minimal elements.</li>\n<li>The order6 minimal-element variant is merged here with the same semantics.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-df-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"P,\\leq_P,X,R,A,m\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Poset}(X,R)","display":false},{"tex":"A\\subseteq P","display":false},{"tex":"A\\subseteq X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder2MinimalElement}_S(m,A,P,\\leq_P)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcOrder6MinimalElement}_S(X,R,A,m)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order2\\text{-}minimal\\text{-}element} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcOrder2MinimalElement}_S(m,A,P,\\leq_P)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Poset}(P,\\leq_P)\\land A\\subseteq P\\land m\\in A\\land \\neg\\exists a\\in A\\;\\bigl(a\\neq m\\land\\langle a,m\\rangle\\in\\leq_P\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}order2\\text{-}minimal\\text{-}element} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcOrder6MinimalElement}_S(X,R,A,m)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Poset}(X,R)\\land A\\subseteq X\\land m\\in A\\land\\forall a\\in A\\;(\\langle a,m\\rangle\\in R\\to a=m)","display":true}],"bytes":1470,"backlinks":[{"id":"363ec18ceab52b90","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2939","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-zfc-order2-minimal-element.md|58-df-zfc-order2-minimal-element]]（batch07）"}],"outgoing":["d3f859dbdd37f018"]}